; Copy this UTF-8 file to overrides.ini beside the application's settings INI.
; Help -> About -> Information -> Using Overrides shows the exact destination.
; Restart the application after editing. This sample is NEVER loaded automatically.
; The Settings UI controls the default User-Agent. Host overrides take priority.
;
; UI default -> matching parent domain -> more-specific host.
; A host section matches that exact host unless IncludeSubdomains=true.
; Hostnames are case-insensitive; query parameter names are case-sensitive.
; Do not include a scheme, port, path or wildcard in a host section.
; Rules cover every feed HEAD/GET request, including discovery and redirects.
; Host rules do not cover favicons, article images or external browser links.
; Wildcards, including [*], are not supported.
;
; Supported keys:
; UserAgent: nonempty single-line string. Omit it to inherit.
;   Quote values containing INI punctuation such as commas or semicolons.
; IncludeSubdomains: true or false (default false).
; RequiredQueryParameters: comma-separated parameter names with nonempty values.
;   An empty value clears inherited requirements. Values are not generated or
;   validated as credentials. Duplicate query keys containing empty values fail.
; MissingParametersMessage: additional explanation, not HTML.
;   Omit to inherit; an empty value clears an inherited explanation.
; Unknown keys or malformed settings disable this whole file and are reported
; in About and the log. No bundled override rules are used as a fallback.
;
; All examples below are commented out. Uncomment only rules you want.

; [example.com]
; IncludeSubdomains=true
; UserAgent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:155.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/155.0"

; Reddit example: enable ONLY if the feeds you use require authenticated URLs.
; This is not a claim that all public Reddit feeds require these parameters.
; "user" and "feed" below are parameter NAMES, not literal required values.
; Obtain your own complete feed URL; do not put a shared token in this sample.
; This host-wide rule also blocks Reddit discovery URLs without the parameters.
; [reddit.com]
; IncludeSubdomains=true
; RequiredQueryParameters=user,feed
; MissingParametersMessage=Copy the complete authenticated feed URL from Reddit, including its user and feed query parameters.
